<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - Trading quiet after hours.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - Trading quiet after hours.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading was very quiet after hours on Friday, traders said.</p>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said its session one volume was 289,100 shares compared to 8,700 shares. Session two volume was 2,164,432 shares compared to 1,769,400 shares.</p>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said it had no after-hours activity.</p>
